# Everything of this machine's that isn't the project's own (README "Setup"): local/
#   work/         build output of install.sh, test logs and slots, caches
#   scratch/      notes and leftovers
#   tools/ venv/  the toolchains (llvm-mingw, Ghidra, JDK) and the Python environment
#   games/ee/ games/aoc/  derived from the games' copyrighted files - regenerate locally, never commit: the Ghidra
#                 projects and C dumps, files extracted from data.ssa / Language.dll, the AI settings tables
#   game_dir.txt  the game folder when the repository is somewhere else (scripts/game_dir.sh, run_test.ps1)
/local/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# never committed wherever they are: the game's files and the build
*.exe
*.ees
*.scn
/dll/*.dll
*.csv
*.png
